<title>AUSTRALIA: SSI China shares head turnover lists.</title>
<headline>SSI China shares head turnover lists.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in China-based conglomerate SSI China Enterprises Ltd headed turnover lists on Wednesday with 22.3 million shares in two lines put through the market prior to the opening.</p>
<p>One line of 10.6 million shares and one of 11.7 million shares were specialled through ANZ Securities at a price of 65 cents per share.</p>
</text>
